[{"title":"观竞渡舟中书呈亦琳迁之 其一","author":"李之世","text":"水涨溪桥百道通，满江烟浪碧濛濛。\n扬舲共逐分龙雨，解缆偏惊舶掉风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27664,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观竞渡舟中书呈亦琳迁之 其二","author":"李之世","text":"岸头挝鼓酹江神，喷雾骊龙斗碧津。\n咫尺停云天共远，一尊风雨暗愁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27665,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别陈生","author":"李之世","text":"平芜十里下苍茫，枫树高凝万叶霜。\n却望故园秋色里，不知天与大江长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27666,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居即影 其一","author":"李之世","text":"小小园畦半亩馀，移来花木渐扶疏。\n长贫闭户不出郭，閒即带经倦带锄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27667,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居即影 其二","author":"李之世","text":"呼童穿沼水泠泠，缏短坭深汲不成。\n昨夜矶头添几尺，满林新笋一齐生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27668,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居即影 其三","author":"李之世","text":"睡残春日较迟迟，兴剧还敲五字诗。\n一把长镵七寸管，六时那有得閒时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27669,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居即影 其四","author":"李之世","text":"自然懒态厌逢人，剥啄从教耳畔频。\n读罢严楞无一事，就床卸却白纶巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27670,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居即影 其五","author":"李之世","text":"宛宛晴云曳钓丝，双双鸂鶒弄明漪。\n偶然拂水轻风过，正是前山落照时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27671,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园居即影 其六","author":"李之世","text":"对水柴门总不关，清溪一雨泻潺湲。\n千林处处如新沭，洗出林端几片山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27672,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行有感","author":"李之世","text":"刺眼繁花的的新，伤心啼鸟一般春。\n十年前度看山眼，屈指于今到几人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27673,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈熙父 其一","author":"李之世","text":"芹芳池畔足幽栖，春日春花鸟乱啼。\n涧户无人昼寂寂，东风閒杀画桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27674,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈熙父 其二","author":"李之世","text":"城边十步一亭台，个个朱甍压面开。\n不是人间常得住，陈琳原是谪仙才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27675,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈熙父 其三","author":"李之世","text":"璧水澄澄玉作钩，黄云冉冉映朱楼。\n悬知多暇聊攀陟，到有新诗在上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27676,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈熙父 其四","author":"李之世","text":"白龙池上白龙湫，分作清溪洗砚流。\n昨夜黑云将雨过，祇惊溪畔墨花浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27677,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈熙父 其五","author":"李之世","text":"谯楼钟动夜初分，半度虚空半入云。\n曾是十年灯火地，那能同听不思君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27678,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈熙父 其六","author":"李之世","text":"东来紫水碧湾环，百折斜穿竹洞关。\n但得买船兼买酒，不妨同去又同还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27679,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏赠梁伯静","author":"李之世","text":"那能逐逐老风尘，三尺虬髯七尺身。\n若待尚平婚嫁毕，古来名岳定无人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27680,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上词 其一","author":"李之世","text":"轻风轻雨端阳时，垂柳垂篁半不支。\n才听画船歌管续，不知残照已西驰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27681,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上词 其二","author":"李之世","text":"蒲叶青青艾酒黄，移来孤艇共相将。\n江头几点分龙雨，一半霏微半夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27682,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园诗 其一","author":"李之世","text":"绿槐阴尽露风梢，庭桧森森翠欲交。\n野鹤窥人驯旧径，鸤鸠将子试新巢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27683,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园诗 其二","author":"李之世","text":"绿叶初残风乍稀，红香飘处逗人衣。\n芙蓉出水枝枝净，橘柚经霜个个肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27684,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园诗 其三","author":"李之世","text":"波容如练泻秋光，习习轻飔拂野塘。\n柳条欲折还依水，荷叶全枯不受霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27685,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园诗 其四","author":"李之世","text":"游花点点曳花须，冷蕊垂垂缀露珠。\n一夜西风摇百草，轻霜凄断白蘼芜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27686,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞门题壁","author":"李之世","text":"洞门十日九日閒，无日无时不闭关。\n儿童惯识常来客，暂放柴扃一往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27687,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访卢斗山不遇","author":"李之世","text":"一径萧萧万玉林，数椽茆屋住山深。\n不知采药何来去，总在云萝无处寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27688,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭蠡壮游卷","author":"李之世","text":"彭蠡湖边湖水秋，君去扬舲湖上游。\n千里湖光千斛酒，与谁同醉木兰舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27689,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南浦别送嗣淳家兄赴京","author":"李之世","text":"南浦溪边春水生，攀条不尽别离情。\n长安车马如流水，天北天南有雁声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27690,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题叶㵵溪隐居","author":"李之世","text":"清溪百折度潺湲，溪上何人独掩关。\n密筱丛篁三径合，落花啼鸟一庭閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27691,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珠江词 其一","author":"李之世","text":"珠江江水碧迢迢，画舫湘帘横玉箫。\n两岸垂杨低拂水，轻风摇过木兰桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27692,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珠江词 其二","author":"李之世","text":"溪边十室九为渔，一叶浮家逐浪居。\n斜日江头歌欸乃，高秋浦口拾芙蕖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27693,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珠江词 其三","author":"李之世","text":"酒旗临岸屋临江，映水朱扉面面窗。\n游人立马羁金络，少妇当垆泻玉缸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27694,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珠江词 其四","author":"李之世","text":"石尤浪起白头风，一点云飞没太空。\n村北村南无处泊，满江烟雨碧濛濛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珠江词 其五","author":"李之世","text":"白浪排山山欲摧，北风打船船不开。\n江边渔父迎人语，如此风涛郎莫回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"珠江词 其六","author":"李之世","text":"清溪茆屋两三家，溪女临流浣落花。\n一片芳心何处著，暗随流水到天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜起烹茶","author":"李之世","text":"空阶泫露竹漙漙，酒气微清枕簟寒。\n茶灶半消烟乍起，一钩残月碧阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送赵弼之吴下省亲","author":"李之世","text":"春江渺渺落鸿孤，送子扁舟下五湖。\n一片白云看不尽，暗随明月入姑苏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水竹山人","author":"李之世","text":"水竹山人水竹居，一壶浊酒一囊书。\n春江春涨绿如发，来往扁舟唤打鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27700,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出郭送黎建和","author":"李之世","text":"钓台百尺瞰渔饥，中有长松大十围。\n此地从来饶古意，送君临水重依依。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27701,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄黎明彝","author":"李之世","text":"城中车马足喧阗，羡汝郊居隔市廛。\n短短野桥临曲水，青青杨柳带疏烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27702,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日鲁子湛书堂赏花同黎建和郑明宰黄茂明分赋 其一","author":"李之世","text":"松坛竹坞净无尘，花院招携及早春。\n如何不饮拚花笑，况复当垆有玉人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27703,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日鲁子湛书堂赏花同黎建和郑明宰黄茂明分赋 其二","author":"李之世","text":"兰灯艳艳漏声长，玉醴频倾琥珀光。\n众客莫愁归路瞑，晚风拚醉百花傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27704,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日鲁子湛书堂赏花同黎建和郑明宰黄茂明分赋 其三","author":"李之世","text":"涧户平临万壑霞，幽栖赢得傍山家。\n当门自种相思树，绕砌全开并蒂花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27705,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日病起","author":"李之世","text":"闭户那堪度一春，从教车马竞芳辰。\n谁能不饮椒花酒，也自萧然一病人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27706,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄罗湘林","author":"李之世","text":"别来双鬓各萧骚，咫尺风烟梦寐劳。\n犹记墨花池畔雨，数拳奇石点庭皋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27707,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄马仲高","author":"李之世","text":"当年裘马盛遨游，聚散江湖一叶舟。\n到处逢人堪买醉，千金还掷锦缠头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27708,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望湖亭候风戏用苏长公语作起句题壁 其一","author":"李之世","text":"望湖亭下水连天，人家多住平湖边。\n扬州估客浮大舶，来往江湖无岁年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27709,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望湖亭候风戏用苏长公语作起句题壁 其二","author":"李之世","text":"望湖亭上风飕飕，亭畔几家红粉楼。\n日暮津头待估客，齐歌一曲古凉州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27710,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕公祠","author":"李之世","text":"南北风尘一骑驰，繁华如梦可胜悲。\n后人不解邯郸枕，秋草茫茫拜古祠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27711,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题主人园馆","author":"李之世","text":"华池浸水澹漫漫，隔岸云阴隐翠峦。\n为爱谢庭风物好，满林新种碧琅玕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27712,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初渡江书寄故园","author":"李之世","text":"渡尽长江万里津，岭梅溪柳几株新。\n故园无恙芳菲在，草色青青似怨人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27713,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书折梅亭","author":"李之世","text":"采采寒香把赠频，一枝犹带故园春。\n凭将驿使传消息，为谢京华久客人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27714,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其一","author":"李之世","text":"泡影空华亦幻缘，来如一梦去如烟。\n人间自有伤心泪，莫道蜉蝣十二年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27715,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其二","author":"李之世","text":"每逢节候一兴悲，阿母来辰去忌时。\n转眼七年弹指过，吞声重续悼亡诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27716,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其三","author":"李之世","text":"刀尺閒抛委箧尘，犹馀丝缕一般新。\n把来传玩人惊诧，却道分明腕有神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27717,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其四","author":"李之世","text":"桐叶拈来赋小诗，曲栏对月赏花时。\n如今花发空庭月，祇有寒螀泣露枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27718,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其五","author":"李之世","text":"晨妆才罢倚花前，牙管濡毫榻旧笺。\n茶灶未寒香未烬，碧窗閒锁日如年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27719,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其六","author":"李之世","text":"阿弟趋庭尔问奇，何来片语解人颐。\n閒房静放葳蕤钥，绛羃笼灯写父诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27720,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其七","author":"李之世","text":"穗帐胧胧烛影斜，胆瓶依旧供时花。\n夜阑髣髴闻歌笑，犹忆中庭玩月华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27721,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其八","author":"李之世","text":"闷来无处可招魂，花里寻香月里痕。\n茉莉满庭闻未况，水光疑晓又疑昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27722,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其九","author":"李之世","text":"盥手案头谱药方，为怜多病礼医王。\n生来未悟身同幻，供佛曾烧永寿香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27723,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其十","author":"李之世","text":"清溪曲曲水悠悠，红叶西风几度秋。\n此日临风伤往事，两行衰泪似溪流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27724,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其十一","author":"李之世","text":"箧里遗编手自摩，数痕铅黛点烟螺。\n愁来病眼那堪阅，消得寒灯泪几多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27725,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼女 其十二","author":"李之世","text":"阿母坟前是尔坟，虚空谁识幻来因。\n游魂若返众香国，应念衰残火宅人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27726,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明山行 其一","author":"李之世","text":"澹澹平芜漠漠烟，荒塘一望转凄然。\n青林夜哭多穷鬼，山北山南飞纸钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27727,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明山行 其二","author":"李之世","text":"西岭松楸东岭坟，丰碑华屋渐成尘。\n惟有青山閒是主，年年插柳度游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27728,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明山行 其三","author":"李之世","text":"高谷深陵几度更，青山一片石崚嶒。\n濛濛草露沾衣湿，暝日风林吹鬼灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27729,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀刘宾墀明府","author":"李之世","text":"湘水遥连汉水长，美人为政有辉光。\n悬知潘县桃初熟，无限春晖照北堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27730,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜刘平子至","author":"李之世","text":"清溪溪畔旧溪堂，九曲溪流曲曲长。\n水自潺湲花自笑，依稀前度识刘郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27731,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听刘郎读书","author":"李之世","text":"空斋閒掩碧苔滋，只隔重门窅若斯。\n惟有书声关不住，听残凉月二更时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27732,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"走笔示刘郎","author":"李之世","text":"非向山头寻老衲，定于花下醉红裙。\n池边日日摊书卷，昨日今朝不对君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27733,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下同平子赏兰","author":"李之世","text":"谁从月里惜香魂，空影流阶澹写痕。\n一片湘帘秋似水，也宜幽客伴黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27734,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叶山人自楚归携诗稿过访辄有此赠 其一","author":"李之世","text":"七十壮游世亦稀，萧萧华发映征衣。\n一囊诗草看犹湿，昨日潇湘江上归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27735,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"叶山人自楚归携诗稿过访辄有此赠 其二","author":"李之世","text":"一片平湖天际青，一点君山水际萍。\n山人诗骨清如鹤，带得烟光过洞庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27736,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠萧威侯 其一","author":"李之世","text":"偶同剩水弄潺湲，水面云生澹澹閒。\n不敢掇来相把赠，君家原住大云山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27737,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠萧威侯 其二","author":"李之世","text":"和丹吮墨几人同，却羡萧郎腕最工。\n欲附溪藤三百纸，春来随意染芳丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27738,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同梁叔熹中林晚眺因而话旧赋赠 其一","author":"李之世","text":"怜君家往碧溪湾，兼有诗情溪水间。\n政值雨晴秋又好，却来台上望圭山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27739,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同梁叔熹中林晚眺因而话旧赋赠 其二","author":"李之世","text":"昔年载酒也同游，霜岸芙蓉叶叶秋。\n醉倒绿杨呼不起，一天凉月侵溪流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27740,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林里望圭峰","author":"李之世","text":"远望遥遥只隔林，由来山色最宜深。\n白云不碍閒来往，才过枝头又度岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27741,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水中山影","author":"李之世","text":"尝闻山上少流泉，水里看山色更妍。\n淡即是云浓即树，问谁图者米家颠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":27742,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]